466
00:30:11,600 --> 00:30:12,800
I pulled them for you.

467
00:30:13,360 --> 00:30:14,120
Keep digging.

468
00:30:15,120 --> 00:30:16,560
I like people

469
00:30:16,680 --> 00:30:18,040
