will probably be back soon.

596
00:38:09,720 --> 00:38:11,160
That day, I got ink

597
00:38:11,160 --> 00:38:12,720
on her shoes.

598
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,000
I didn't mean to.

599
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:16,760
I know.

600
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:23,960
Is she not coming home

601
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,480
because she's mad at me?

602
00:38:25,640 --> 00:38:26,800
Of course not.

603
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:30,200
Finish your homework.

604
00:38:33,080 --> 00:38:34,600
She'll be home soon.

605
00:38:57,800 --> 00:38:58,560
Mom.

606
00:39:00,040 --> 00:39:00,920
What's wrong?

607
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:02,600
Nothing.

608
00:39:06,480 --> 00:39:07,160
I'm okay.

609
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:21,120
What do you want?

610
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:24,960
Didn't we say we'd study after school?

611
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:25,480
Let's go.

612
00:39:25,480 --> 00:39:26,240
I have to go home.

613
00:39:26,240 --> 00:39:27,160
It's urgent at home.

614
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:28,200
I really have to-

615
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:29,000
All good.

616
00:39:29,000 --> 00:39:30,160
There's a chair. Sit.

617
00:39:30,520 --> 00:39:31,400
Sit down.

618
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:32,280
We said sit.

619
00:39:32,760 --> 00:39:33,600
Didn't you hear us?

620
00:39:33,680 --> 00:39:34,400
What do you want?

621
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:35,480
Let go of me!

622
00:39:37,200 --> 00:39:37,760
What are you doing?

623
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:38,480
Help! Anyone?

624
00:39:38,520 --> 00:39:39,480
Hey, Jiang Ting.

625
00:39:42,200 --> 00:39:43,480
Please let me go.

626
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:44,840
Getting impatient?

627
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:47,240
Today's on me.

628
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:55,920
I picked my favorite flavor for you.

629
00:39:56,160 --> 00:39:57,680
Somebody help me!

630
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:59,280
I told you to mind your business.

631
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:01,200
Why did you go to Zhou Xijie?

632
00:40:05,320 --> 00:40:05,920
Talk!

633
00:40:06,560 --> 00:40:08,280
Why are you looking for Su Lin?

634
00:40:15,320 --> 00:40:16,680
That's what you get for snooping.

635
00:40:18,840 --> 00:40:20,920
Why did you have to go
looking for Zhou Xijie?

636
00:40:21,760 --> 00:40:22,520
Does it hurt?

637
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:24,560
Stay back!

638
00:40:24,760 --> 00:40:25,600
Don't come closer!

639
00:40:27,160 --> 00:40:28,960
Stay back!

640
00:40:29,040 --> 00:40:30,280
It's a dead end.

641
00:40:30,680 --> 00:40:31,720
Where can you run?

642
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,120
Not bad.

643
00:40:34,880 --> 00:40:35,520
Stay back!

644
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:37,320
Stay back!

645
00:40:38,560 --> 00:40:39,360
A compass.

646
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:41,560
Come on. Stab me.

647
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:42,640
Stay back!

648
00:40:56,720 --> 00:40:57,520
Don't come!

649
00:40:58,200 --> 00:40:59,080
Don't!

650
00:41:02,140 --> 00:41:05,060
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

651
00:41:05,560 --> 00:41:06,040
Young girl.

652
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,520
Could I have a moment?

653
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:09,760
I wanted to ask

654
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:11,240
if you know a student

655
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:12,200
named Su Lin.

656
00:41:13,800 --> 00:41:14,360
Keep running.

657
00:41:14,440 --> 00:41:15,000
Stay back!

658
00:41:15,600 --> 00:41:16,040
Stay back!

659
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:20,400
What are you doing?

660
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:25,760
This tape

661
00:41:26,720 --> 00:41:29,280
recorded everything
that has just happened here.

662
