♪Moonlight splinters into shards♪

666
00:42:15,980 --> 00:42:19,380
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

667
00:42:21,780 --> 00:42:27,020
♪Dust drifts through the silent abyss♪

668
00:42:27,620 --> 00:42:32,820
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

669
00:42:33,580 --> 00:42:39,220
♪Tides recede; we grow in the dark♪

670
00:43:03,340 --> 00:43:06,300
♪Don't look back, don't look back♪

671
00:43:09,260 --> 00:43:14,660
♪Memories buried, sorrow forgotten♪

672
00:43:15,020 --> 00:43:18,420
♪Swim ahead, swim ahead♪

673
00:43:20,940 --> 00:43:26,500
♪Deep-sea wounds, we swim upstream♪

